1
00:00:00,520 --> 00:00:02,280
=You Alone Know Me=

2
00:00:02,280 --> 00:00:03,892
(From the Qimao novel "My Bestie's Icy
Dad Got Drunk and Wild After We Wed")

3
00:00:03,892 --> 00:00:04,920
(Written by Qiaoqiaojiang)

4
00:00:05,120 --> 00:00:08,040
=Episode 20=

5
00:00:17,120 --> 00:00:18,359
(Is this karma?)

6
00:00:19,480 --> 00:00:20,879
(I only let myself go last night,)

7
00:00:21,039 --> 00:00:22,399
(and now this happens.)

8
00:00:23,280 --> 00:00:24,600
(How embarrassing.)

9
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:32,520
Um...

10
00:00:33,280 --> 00:00:35,719
I want to buy something.

11
00:00:44,600 --> 00:00:46,719
I wondered why you suddenly had time

12
00:00:47,359 --> 00:00:48,880
to take me to Tingge for lunch.

13
00:00:50,280 --> 00:00:52,439
Worried Ling Hao would mistreat Lin Hua?

14
00:00:53,359 --> 00:00:54,600
Or worried

15
00:00:55,200 --> 00:00:56,280
she couldn't win him over?

16
00:00:56,679 --> 00:00:57,439
It's a coincidence.

17
00:00:59,240 --> 00:00:59,799
True.

18
00:01:00,359 --> 00:01:02,000
She'll have to marry sooner or later.

19
00:01:02,399 --> 00:01:03,799
But judging by his face,

20
00:01:04,120 --> 00:01:05,120
Ling Hao likes her.

21
00:01:06,640 --> 00:01:08,120
Congratulations to the Gu family.

22
00:01:08,359 --> 00:01:10,519
Another powerful business partner.

23
00:01:12,239 --> 00:01:13,200
She won't marry for business.

24
00:01:14,599 --> 00:01:15,439
You can marry for business.

25
00:01:15,480 --> 00:01:16,280
Why can't she?

26
00:01:16,760 --> 00:01:17,760
Your family raised her.

27
00:01:18,120 --> 00:01:19,200
If she's grateful at all,

28
00:01:19,400 --> 00:01:20,719
she'll agree to this marriage.

29
00:01:33,439 --> 00:01:35,239
You can put me down now.

30
00:01:35,359 --> 00:01:35,959
No need to carry me.

31
00:01:36,840 --> 00:01:37,560
Does your belly still hurt?

32
00:01:38,159 --> 00:01:39,000
Not too much.

33
00:01:39,319 --> 00:01:40,200
You know, Mrs. Xie,

34
00:01:40,439 --> 00:01:41,680
you could take the lead like last night

35
00:01:42,280 --> 00:01:43,480
and tell me what to do more often.

36
00:01:44,040 --> 00:01:44,480
I...

37
00:01:45,400 --> 00:01:46,680
I told you.

38
00:01:47,200 --> 00:01:47,879
Last night,

39
00:01:48,879 --> 00:01:50,560
I got carried away after drinking.

40
00:01:50,719 --> 00:01:51,239
Okay.

41
00:01:52,480 --> 00:01:54,439
I'm the one you can take it out on.

42
00:01:55,079 --> 00:01:55,840
Then, in return,

43
00:01:57,040 --> 00:01:58,200
don't I get to hold you for a bit?

44
00:02:29,560 --> 00:02:31,000
I wasn't sure which brand you use,

45
00:02:32,000 --> 00:02:33,159
so I got a few of each.

46
00:02:41,400 --> 00:02:42,000
Thank you.

47
00:02:54,120 --> 00:02:54,759
Not bad.

48
00:02:56,319 --> 00:02:57,439
So, Lin Hua,

49
00:02:58,280 --> 00:02:59,080
do you have a boyfriend?

50
00:03:02,280 --> 00:03:02,719
Yes.

51
00:03:02,879 --> 00:03:03,520
You do?

52
00:03:04,680 --> 00:03:06,199
What's he like? Is he handsome?

53
00:03:11,520 --> 00:03:13,599
Thank you for always being there.

54
00:03:15,159 --> 00:03:16,000
I always will be.

55
00:03:18,319 --> 00:03:19,840
Li Sirong and Li Siyan's punishment.

56
00:03:20,400 --> 00:03:21,400
That was you, wasn't it?

57
00:03:21,960 --> 00:03:23,800
No one gets to hurt my wife.

58
00:03:28,879 --> 00:03:29,439
Is it good?

59
00:03:30,599 --> 00:03:31,120
It is.

60
00:03:32,919 --> 00:03:34,080
Does this make me

61
00:03:34,680 --> 00:03:37,960
a Cinderella who met Prince Charming.

62
00:03:38,759 --> 00:03:39,879
It should be the Frog Prince

63
00:03:41,199 --> 00:03:42,319
meeting his Snow White.

64
00:03:48,319 --> 00:03:49,400
He's quite tall.

65
00:03:50,479 --> 00:03:51,240
Doesn't talk much,

66
00:03:52,520 --> 00:03:53,520
but he's a great cook.

67
00:03:54,639 --> 00:03:55,159
That's it?

68
00:03:58,800 --> 00:04:00,319
You're describing your boyfriend

69
00:04:00,520 --> 00:04:02,159
like he's a fridge.

70
00:04:03,159 --> 00:04:03,599
Tall.

71
00:04:04,599 --> 00:04:05,240
Quiet.

72
00:04:06,360 --> 00:04:07,759
Keeps food fresh.

73
00:04:10,560 --> 00:04:11,639
Now that you mention it,

74
00:04:11,800 --> 00:04:12,759
he really is like a fridge.

75
00:04:14,039 --> 00:04:15,479
Cold on the outside,

76
00:04:15,919 --> 00:04:17,240
but open the door

77
00:04:17,439 --> 00:04:18,839
and it's full of treats just for me.

78
00:04:19,560 --> 00:04:20,399
Then...

79
00:04:21,040 --> 00:04:21,759
do you like him?

80
00:04:25,959 --> 00:04:27,120
I...

81
00:04:32,160 --> 00:04:32,959
I don't know.

82
00:04:35,439 --> 00:04:37,519
That means you do.

83
00:04:38,959 --> 00:04:40,000
If you didn't,

84
00:04:40,079 --> 00:04:41,199
you'd just say no.

85
00:04:42,079 --> 00:04:43,360
Saying you don't know

86
00:04:43,839 --> 00:04:45,360
means you've already fallen for him,

87
00:04:45,600 --> 00:04:47,879
but aren't ready to admit it.

88
00:04:50,519 --> 00:04:51,560
Really?

89
00:04:52,680 --> 00:04:53,800
Go for it, Hua.

90
00:04:54,399 --> 00:04:55,800
You deserve to be treated well.

91
00:04:58,360 --> 00:04:59,120
Yeah.

92
00:05:00,279 --> 00:05:00,959
Let's eat.

93
00:05:07,639 --> 00:05:10,040
(Do I really like him?)

94
00:05:11,680 --> 00:05:12,240
(No.)

95
00:05:12,879 --> 00:05:14,120
(I can't get hurt by love again.)

96
00:05:15,319 --> 00:05:16,399
(Scan for free eggs)
Real free-range eggs!

97
00:05:17,079 --> 00:05:17,879
(Good news)
Scan for free eggs!

98
00:05:18,480 --> 00:05:19,600
More scans, more eggs!

99
00:05:20,079 --> 00:05:20,879
Genuine free-range eggs!

100
00:05:21,279 --> 00:05:22,079
More scans, more eggs!

101
00:05:22,360 --> 00:05:22,920
Young man,

102
00:05:23,560 --> 00:05:24,720
are these really free-range eggs?

103
00:05:25,160 --> 00:05:26,680
I don't eat factory-farmed eggs.

104
00:05:27,000 --> 00:05:28,360
Ma'am, of course they are.

105
00:05:28,639 --> 00:05:29,480
Take them home and enjoy.

106
00:05:29,680 --> 00:05:31,199
If they're not, I'll pay you 500 yuan.

107
00:05:31,480 --> 00:05:32,199
Scan here.

108
00:05:32,319 --> 00:05:33,079
Right here?

109
00:05:33,240 --> 00:05:33,639
All right.

110
00:05:33,680 --> 00:05:34,160
Scan here.

111
00:05:34,680 --> 00:05:35,759
Genuine free-range eggs!

112
00:05:36,439 --> 00:05:37,480
Scan and get them free!

113
00:05:37,759 --> 00:05:38,680
Don't scan that code.

114
00:05:39,079 --> 00:05:40,000
Why not?

115
00:05:40,360 --> 00:05:41,319
Let me explain.

116
00:05:42,120 --> 00:05:43,319
If you scan it,

117
00:05:43,519 --> 00:05:45,399
your personal information could leak.

118
00:05:45,839 --> 00:05:47,079
Your phone could get a virus,

119
00:05:47,240 --> 00:05:48,399
and your bank card could stop working.

120
00:05:48,920 --> 00:05:50,040
It's very dangerous.

121
00:05:50,439 --> 00:05:51,120
Besides,

122
00:05:51,360 --> 00:05:52,759
these aren't free-range eggs.

123
00:05:53,079 --> 00:05:54,560
Real ones aren't this clean.

124
00:05:55,720 --> 00:05:56,920
What are you doing?

125
00:05:57,199 --> 00:05:58,439
Mind your own business, got it?

126
00:05:58,800 --> 00:05:59,759
Mind my own business?

127
00:06:00,040 --> 00:06:00,839
How about I call the police

128
00:06:00,959 --> 00:06:01,920
and have them check

129
00:06:02,040 --> 00:06:03,839
whether this is legitimate?

130
00:06:04,839 --> 00:06:05,360
Call the police!

131
00:06:06,000 --> 00:06:07,120
You tried to trick me!

132
00:06:07,560 --> 00:06:08,800
Thank you, dear.

133
00:06:08,800 --> 00:06:09,399
It's nothing.

134
00:06:10,160 --> 00:06:11,040
It's dangerous.

135
00:06:11,120 --> 00:06:12,199
Don't scan random codes again.

136
00:06:12,360 --> 00:06:13,279
I understand.

137
00:06:16,399 --> 00:06:17,000
Dear,

138
00:06:17,600 --> 00:06:19,319
you're so pretty.

139
00:06:19,839 --> 00:06:21,639
If only you'd marry my grandson.

140
00:06:22,040 --> 00:06:22,800
Ma'am,

141
00:06:23,279 --> 00:06:24,399
I have a boyfriend.

142
00:06:25,199 --> 00:06:27,000
A lovely girl,
wasted on someone undeserving.

143
00:06:28,920 --> 00:06:30,519
If you can't marry my grandson,

144
00:06:31,160 --> 00:06:33,120
we can still be friends, age gap or not.

145
00:06:33,560 --> 00:06:35,360
I'm Song Yazhi. And you?

146
00:06:36,040 --> 00:06:37,279
I'm Lin Hua.

147
00:06:38,120 --> 00:06:39,639
I'll call you Hua, then.

148
00:06:41,199 --> 00:06:41,639
By the way,

149
00:06:42,040 --> 00:06:42,519
Hua,

150
00:06:42,879 --> 00:06:44,000
how old is your boyfriend?

151
00:06:44,759 --> 00:06:46,800
He's thirty-five.

152
00:06:47,439 --> 00:06:49,480
So is my grandson.

153
00:06:51,160 --> 00:06:53,639
Come eat with me
at the retirement home next door.

154
00:06:53,800 --> 00:06:54,519
The chef

155
00:06:54,639 --> 00:06:56,120
used to work at a big hotel.

156
00:06:56,279 --> 00:06:57,759
His food is delicious.

157
00:06:58,240 --> 00:06:58,839
Ma'am,

158
00:06:59,600 --> 00:07:01,480
why are you at a retirement home?

159
00:07:02,000 --> 00:07:03,240
Don't you live with your family?

160
00:07:03,839 --> 00:07:05,519
The house is too big and quiet.

161
00:07:05,959 --> 00:07:07,120
I'm keeping my old friends company.

162
00:07:10,639 --> 00:07:11,199
Hua,

163
00:07:12,120 --> 00:07:13,839
break up with your boyfriend

164
00:07:14,160 --> 00:07:15,720
and marry my grandson.

165
00:07:16,120 --> 00:07:17,079
That grandson of mine

166
00:07:17,240 --> 00:07:19,000
likes girls just like you,

167
00:07:19,160 --> 00:07:20,800
sweet and pretty.

168
00:07:21,560 --> 00:07:23,839
Please don't tease me, ma'am.

169
00:07:41,280 --> 00:07:41,888
♪You say you♪

170
00:07:41,889 --> 00:07:44,080
♪Don't need anyone♪
(Signature page, Party A Xie Zhouhan)

171
00:07:44,400 --> 00:07:47,480
♪You're just fine on your own♪

172
00:07:47,760 --> 00:07:50,640
♪I see the pride behind your smile♪

173
00:07:50,640 --> 00:07:53,640
♪And the pain you face at night♪

174
00:07:54,360 --> 00:07:57,320
♪Sometimes love isn't about possession♪

175
00:07:57,640 --> 00:08:00,520
♪It's tenderness that sets you free♪

176
00:08:00,520 --> 00:08:03,600
♪Some love needs no promises♪

177
00:08:03,600 --> 00:08:06,960
♪I'll face this cold world with you♪

178
00:08:06,960 --> 00:08:09,640
♪I keep my feelings safely hidden♪

179
00:08:09,640 --> 00:08:12,960
♪Quietly staying behind you♪

180
00:08:12,960 --> 00:08:15,800
♪I'm right behind you♪

181
00:08:16,080 --> 00:08:19,360
♪Shielding you from every hidden storm♪

182
00:08:19,360 --> 00:08:22,000
♪Keeping the rain out of your eyes♪

183
00:08:22,000 --> 00:08:25,960
♪So you can walk ahead without fear♪

184
00:08:28,840 --> 00:08:32,280
♪I'm right behind you♪

185
00:08:32,280 --> 00:08:34,080
♪Waiting for you to turn around♪

186
00:08:34,080 --> 00:08:35,920
♪Waiting for you to finally see♪

187
00:08:35,920 --> 00:08:38,480
♪You're the only one I lose control for♪

188
00:08:38,480 --> 00:08:39,920
♪I'm right behind you♪

189
00:08:39,920 --> 00:08:42,280
♪Loving you gently, though no one knows♪

190
00:08:42,280 --> 00:08:44,040
♪I won't claim you♪

191
00:08:44,040 --> 00:08:45,720
♪I won't ask you to stay♪

192
00:08:45,720 --> 00:08:48,360
♪I'll spend the rest of my life♪

193
00:08:49,280 --> 00:08:51,720
♪Waiting for you♪
